title: lit cells in a row across time could represent advances in a pitch series
pid: 6e7f255a-e67a-4129-bd27-b6fb5e287c50
body: |2-
  A row that in a simpler sequencer represents "one" [pitch, sample, ..]
  against time could be for a series of them.
  Each lit cell in the row plays a note and advance the series.
